---
const slides = [
  { src: '/company/about-us/Artboard-1.webp', alt: 'Flycatch team collaborating in the studio' },
  { src: '/company/about-us/Artboard-2.webp', alt: 'Flycatch teammates reviewing work together' },
  { src: '/company/about-us/Artboard-3.webp', alt: 'Flycatch office collaboration' },
  { src: '/company/about-us/Artboard-6.webp', alt: 'Flycatch colleagues in discussion' },
  { src: '/company/about-us/Artboard-7.webp', alt: 'Flycatch team workshop' },
  { src: '/company/about-us/Artboard-9.webp', alt: 'Flycatch teammates celebrating together' },
];
---
<section class="about-career" aria-labelledby="about-career-heading">
  <div class="container about-career-grid">
    <div class="about-career-media">
      <div class="swiper about-career-swiper" data-about-career-swiper>
        <div class="swiper-wrapper">
          {slides.map((slide) => (
            <div class="swiper-slide about-career-slide">
              <img
                src={slide.src}
                alt={slide.alt}
                width="480"
                height="600"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-career-copy">
      <h2 id="about-career-heading" class="type-section">Grow your career with us</h2>
      <p class="lede type-lede">
        Flycatch's journey all along is rooted by some firm beliefs and ethics which will never change.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a class="btn" href="/company/jobs-openings">
          Explore opportunities
          <img src="/icon-arrow-right.svg" width="24" height="24" alt="" />
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="../scripts/about-career.ts"></script>
